                    <data value="&quot;As you reach Wing Guard Headquarters, you take out your comlink and comm Merayna. 'You've reached Headquarters? Very good,' Merayna says. 'I just heard from Tiatkin. She is in position at the rear entrance to the building and will rendezvous with you inside. Work with her to reach the top floor and deactivate the isolation protocol'.&quot;" name="journalEntryDescription" />
